# Docs tracked in git (one path per line, relative to docs/).
#
# Default: everything under docs/ is gitignored (setup/planning notes stay local).
# Add a path here ONLY when a doc is required for build, runtime, or final ops.
#
# After editing, run:  npm run docs:git-sync
#
# Examples (uncomment when needed):
# environment-variables.md
# api/recommendation-agent.md
strategist-optimization-plan.md
strategist-eval-matrix.md
v2-orphan-inventory.md
